 ('Whitecrest Boarding Spear','Weapon','mundane',75,'weapon',('stat','damage',1),'A short ash-shafted boarding spear with a securely socketed steel head and a capped butt.'),
 ('Reefhook Knife','Weapon','mundane',35,'weapon',('skill','Finesse Combat',1),'A compact curved knife used to cut fouled line and defend a cramped foothold.'),
 ('Sailor’s Padded Coat','Armor','mundane',65,'body',('stat','armor',4),'A quilted working coat reinforced at the shoulders, with enough freedom to haul a rope.'),
 ('Tidewalker Boots','Armor','artisan',180,'feet',('skill','acrobatics',3),'Grippy fitted boots with replaceable soles, made for slippery deck planks and wet stone.'),
